 "description": "48-port serial console server, 1RU. The Front is a blank plate carrying two stacked USB-A ports, the console RJ45 and the SYS and PWR lamps. The Rear carries the 48 RJ45 serial ports in two rows of 24, in three blocks of eight columns, odd numbers above even. It also has two Ethernet RJ45 ports, two SFP cages and two AC inlets each with a rocker switch. Modelled as the dual-AC build with no 5G or analog-modem option, NSCP-T48R-CORE-DAC, the one the data sheet shows.",
